  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of agricultural advisory services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support Government efforts to develop a strategy and an effective collaborative implementing framework for a sustainable agricultural extension support service that is better able to respond to current and future challenges in the agriculture sector and ultimately improve rural livelihoods. Also, to assist the Government of Azerbaijan and service providers in rural areas to better understand and adopt operational systems, processes and services that are more focused, targeted and relevant to increasing farm incomes while protecting and enhancing the natural environment.</narrative>
  </description>
